lain\">entry point is src/atlas/main.py. Always run `make lint` before</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">committing.</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"># Layer 9: Timestamp + session</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Current time: 2026-03-30T14:30:00-07:00</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Session: abc123</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"># Layer 10: Platform hint</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">You are a CLI AI Agent. Try not to use markdown but simple text</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">renderable inside a terminal.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">platform_hints</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">whatsapp</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">append</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">&gt;</span><span class=\"token scalar string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token scalar string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">      When tabular output would be useful, invoke the table_formatting</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token scalar string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">      skill instead of emitting a Markdown table.</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">slack</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">replace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;You are on Slack. Keep responses tight and avoid wide tables.&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">telegram</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;Prefer short messages; split long answers.&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\">   </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># shorthand = append</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-p